Food allergy in France? Say this at the restaurant 🍽️🇫🇷

• je suis allergique à = I'm allergic to
• les noix = nuts
• sans = without
• il y a de la crème = there's cream
• une carafe d'eau = a jug of (free) tap water

🙏 Know someone with an allergy? Send this to them — and comment "Je suis allergique à ___" 👇
💌 Save this before you eat out in France
👯 Send it to someone with a food allergy

Small steps. Big dreams ✨

